WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.452 --> 00:00:03.976
创建并命名本轮请求 / Create and name this request

2
00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:06.995
填写本轮公开测试地址 / Enter the public test URL

3
00:00:06.995 --> 00:00:10.888
保存公开Header但不Send / Save a public Header without sending

4
00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:13.890
检查Collection Export审批 / Inspect Collection Export approval

5
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.916
Deny不写出文件 / Deny without writing a file

6
00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:30.071
再次请求Export并Allow / Request Export again and allow it

7
00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:35.435
在自有目录查看Save面板 / Inspect Save in the owned directory

8
00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.445
取消原生Save后没有导出 / Native Save cancellation does not export

9
00:00:38.445 --> 00:00:50.804
请求真正保存的Export / Request the Export to save

10
00:00:50.804 --> 00:00:55.068
保存guide-tool-collection.json / Save guide-tool-collection.json

11
00:00:55.068 --> 00:00:58.042
检查产品实际导出的文件 / Inspect the file actually exported by the product

12
00:00:58.042 --> 00:01:01.038
检查Import自己的审批 / Inspect the separate Import approval

13
00:01:01.038 --> 00:01:04.101
Deny不导入Collection / Deny without importing the Collection

14
00:01:04.101 --> 00:01:20.346
Allow后仍需要Open面板 / Allow still requires an Open panel

15
00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:26.971
只选择本流程导出的文件 / Select only this flow’s exported file

16
00:01:26.971 --> 00:01:29.964
取消Open保留原集合 / Cancel Open and retain the original Collection

17
00:01:29.964 --> 00:01:45.739
再次检查Import审批 / Review Import approval again

18
00:01:45.739 --> 00:01:50.750
打开同一份产品文件 / Open the same product-created file

19
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.767
读取真实导入预览 / Read the actual import preview

20
00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:56.847
取消预览不修改集合 / Cancel preview without changing the Collection

21
00:01:56.847 --> 00:02:12.906
再次检查Import审批 / Review Import approval again

22
00:02:12.906 --> 00:02:18.048
打开同一份产品文件 / Open the same product-created file

23
00:02:18.048 --> 00:02:21.061
读取真实导入预览 / Read the actual import preview

24
00:02:21.061 --> 00:02:24.144
确认追加而不覆盖原请求 / Confirm append without replacing the original request

25
00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:39.266
为本轮重复导入选择Auto / Select Auto for this repeated import

26
00:02:39.266 --> 00:02:44.354
Auto仍使用真实Open / Auto still uses native Open

27
00:02:44.354 --> 00:02:47.446
Auto仍等待产品预览确认 / Auto still waits for product preview confirmation

28
00:02:47.446 --> 00:02:50.529
确认第二次追加并检查独立身份 / Confirm the second append and check distinct identities

29
00:02:50.529 --> 00:02:54.027
关闭本轮MCP Server / Disable this run’s MCP Server
